<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To the foe my word is always, “No,”</l><l>To the Father it is, “Yes“;</l><l>’Tis my attitude eternal;</l><l>May the Lord protect and bless,</l><l>Lest while walking in obedience</l><l>Satan undermine the way;</l><l>When I’m list’ning to Thine orders,</l><l>Grant me mercy, Lord, I pray.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To the foe my word is always, “No,”</l><l>To the Father it is, “Yes“;</l><l>I completely would obey Him,</l><l>Though deep suff’ring may oppress.</l><l>If the Lord will save and keep me,</l><l>As I forward press with Him,</l><l>Then no trials shall prevent me,</l><l>Nor will opposition grim.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
